OL,3,APeople queue for water as 8,500 without
OL,4,Asupply
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency bottled water stations have
OL,7,Fbeen operating since 08:00 GMT,
OL,8,Falthough supplies temporarily ran out
OL,9,Fat one site before a fresh delivery was
OL,10,Farranged.
OL,12,FSevern Trent said bottled water would
OL,13,Fbe available until 22:00 on Wednesday
OL,14,Fand every day until supplies were
OL,15,Frestored, but warned the complex repair
OL,16,Fcould take several more days.
